version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrozali/chaotic-kummer"
abstract: "Companion repository for the Letter Onset of quantum chaos in a family of two-dimensional conformal field theories (arXiv:2611.26694), released with the Agentic Publication Protocol. It contains the paper source, the code that builds the first-order matrices of exactly marginal deformations of the K3 sigma model at the Kummer orbifold point from free-field data, the stored first-order spectra for the reference direction, 20 random directions and the singlet direction up to level E = 8, and scripts that reproduce the figures and the table of the Letter and check its numerical statements."
keywords:
  - "quantum chaos"
  - "random matrix theory"
  - "two-dimensional conformal field theory"
  - "K3 sigma model"
  - "Kummer orbifold"
  - "exactly marginal deformations"
  - "D1-D5 system"
  - "anomalous dimensions"
  - "level statistics"
